1
00:00:00,012 --> 00:00:04,690
You look after everyone. Who
looks after you,

2
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:05,860
between tasks?

3
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:09,691
This is Serein. A little room to breathe.

4
00:00:09,741 --> 00:00:13,929
Serein makes room for you. A
two minute pause,

5
00:00:13,929 --> 00:00:16,256
with no streak to keep.

6
00:00:16,306 --> 00:00:20,053
Breathe in, gently. And let it go,

7
00:00:20,053 --> 00:00:21,660
without forcing it.

8
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:24,754
Find the practice that fits the moment,

9
00:00:24,754 --> 00:00:26,929
from one minute to five.

10
00:00:26,979 --> 00:00:31,081
Tell Serein how you feel and
where you are,

11
00:00:31,081 --> 00:00:33,816
and it suggests the right reset.

12
00:00:33,866 --> 00:00:40,912
Fifteen practices. Twelve illustrated
guides. Two minutes is enough.

13
00:00:40,912 --> 00:00:44,826
And nothing, ever, is monitored.

14
00:00:44,876 --> 00:00:50,821
Beautiful guides remind you that
pressure at work is shared,

15
00:00:50,821 --> 00:00:52,604
never yours alone.

16
00:00:52,737 --> 00:00:57,792
Gentle journeys guide you, one
small step at a time.

17
00:00:57,842 --> 00:01:01,803
Small tools for real shifts. Before,

18
00:01:01,803 --> 00:01:03,784
during, and after.

19
00:01:03,834 --> 00:01:08,593
Save what helps, and build a
routine that is yours.

20
00:01:08,643 --> 00:01:11,863
And if it is too heavy today,

21
00:01:11,863 --> 00:01:14,623
real support is one tap away.

22
00:01:14,673 --> 00:01:18,025
Follow a gentle square. Breathe in,

23
00:01:18,025 --> 00:01:22,495
hold, breathe out, rest. The
holds are optional,

24
00:01:22,495 --> 00:01:25,289
and the pace is yours.

25
00:01:25,339 --> 00:01:29,181
Ninety seconds for tired hands. Settle,

26
00:01:29,181 --> 00:01:36,226
open gently, and rest. Stop or adapt
whenever you need to.

27
00:01:36,276 --> 00:01:41,466
Choose from fifteen short
practices. Breathing,

28
00:01:41,466 --> 00:01:46,655
grounding, gentle movement,
awareness and visualisation.

29
00:01:46,705 --> 00:01:51,488
Build a one minute ritual
before your shift.

30
00:01:51,488 --> 00:01:55,673
Water, food, one settling
step, one intention,

31
00:01:55,673 --> 00:01:59,260
and one support to ask for.

32
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:03,250
And when work itself is the problem,

33
00:02:03,250 --> 00:02:10,005
map it. Six work design areas help you
agree a positive change

34
00:02:10,005 --> 00:02:10,568
together.

35
00:02:10,618 --> 00:02:11,099
Serein is free, for everyone, always.

36
00:02:11,099 --> 00:02:11,500
Take your first pause today.

